    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR4h0001-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">Principles:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">To commend the worthy and revere virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">casts a lasting light for a thousand years;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">to honor the root and respect beginnings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">naturally extends the meaning far and wide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">King Yuán of Chǔ accumulated benevolence and laid the foundation of virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">opening up this territory;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">his virtuous customs and moral achievements</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">set an example for future generations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">The prosperity of his lineage</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">truly honors our humble clan;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">his lasting fragrance and remaining influence</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">inspire hundreds of generations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">Yet his burial mound is overgrown,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">and the tomb is untended.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">Feeling for the distant past and preserving memories,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">I am filled with deep emotion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">It is said that loving the people extends to loving the trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">and even the sweet pear tree should not be cut down;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">to seek out and honor ancestral tombs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">even the tomb of Lord Xìnlíng should not be forgotten.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">How much more so should we honor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">the source from which our lineage sprang and the origin from which our dynasty began!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">Let us exempt the five families nearest the tomb</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">and perpetually provide them with the task of sweeping and cleaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">This should be implemented immediately.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
